{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"储能","country":"奥地利","country_iso":"AUT","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:40:36.364024","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"AUT-ES-0001","ldc":"No","location":"维也纳地区","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"奥地利维也纳地区12.5MWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Austria Vienna Region 12.5MWh Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"特隆美储能","content":"近日，特隆美储能与\n奥地利最大区域能源供应商Wien Energie签订12.5MWh\n储能合作项目。该项目不仅是奥地利境内具有示范意义的储能部署案例，也为中欧与东欧地区的能源结构转型提供了实践参考。\nWien Energie作为奥地利能源体系的重要支柱企业，隶属于维也纳市政集团Wiener Stadtwerke，服务约两百万居民与二十三万家工商业用户。该公司积极推动清洁能源转型，计划于2040年前实现气候中和。\n随着欧洲能源系统加速向可再生能源转型，电网灵活性及稳定性成为关键挑战。特隆美此次中标的项目，采用系统化全栈交付方案，涵盖系统设计、设备供应、工程实施与调试投运全流程，展现出公司在复杂能源项目中提供定制化、本地化服务的能力和优势。\n项目预计于今年内投运，届时将有效提升维也纳地区的电网调节能力，促进可再生能源消纳，优化区域能源使用效率。该系统的落地，不仅是技术方案的实现，更是特隆美在欧洲市场执行高标准、本地化项目的重要里程碑。","content_sha256":"11325b2fe5e3a4f7fb19682caa275692c0907c6e3f329adc2fb27a039faac07b","id":1252,"publish_date":"2025-11-08 11:16:43","title":"特隆美储能奥地利中标12.5MWh项目","title_sha256":"d5a31b9607fc654fb1a280585345281adb97f7558bc72ce97a024c3bf89573ac","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/89774.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"AUT-ES-0001","capacity_details":"BESS: 12.5MW","capacity_mw":12.5,"capacity_mw_raw":"12.5","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:40:36.364059","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"AUT-ES-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://mcn.solarbe.com/news/20251108/50012135.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"Wien Energie","project_developer_en